      "speaker_code": "EC011",
      "text": "I mean, like if I were to get work in terms of like, if it's a new task that I'm, you know, doing, then if there's any, if someone is teaching me, I would just, just, you know, like just take it down like all in a spreadsheet and then if I forget anything or, you know, then I can always just check again with the person.",
