      "speaker_role": "participant",
      "speaker_code": "EC011",
      "text": "My manager will be like, oh, okay, this… change it for you you know something like small small stuff you know okay thanks you know yeah small things depends i mean sometimes also it's good to have a good how to say a good culture team culture so that really you don't really like…",
