      "speaker_role": "therapist",
      "speaker_code": "CD",
      "text": "Yes, someone else check on you yes and also other people maybe run another check for you in that sense right yeah so that means that sometimes we we can no matter how how careful we are with our attention surely there will be some sort of things we overlook",
