      "speaker_role": "therapist",
      "speaker_code": "CD",
      "text": "Generally it's also like to be mindful like you see if you're really tired and you have a lot of things to check even though mundane but the amount is there right you may have to take a break first before you do that because you're tired physically tired you should just refresh yourself walk around have something to drink come back and continue rather than keep going because after a while your mind will just take a break on its own don't want to concentrate on the task and then there will be things you missed out right yeah yeah",
